   "note": "26 accent options = 25 chromatic scales + gray. Each scale has steps 1-12, alpha a1-a12, plus --X-surface, --X-indicator (=9), --X-track (=9), --X-contrast. Hex shown are sRGB values for step 1-12 light/dark."
