  "darkMode": "Every scale ships a light and dark set; dark is selected via .dark / .dark-theme class or Theme appearance=dark. Steps keep identical meaning in both modes so components never branch. Alpha steps (a1-a12) are generated to look the same over any page background. Shadows are separately redefined in dark (stronger black alphas, gray-a6 hairline).",
  "contrastNotes": "Steps 11 and 12 are guaranteed APCA Lc 60 and Lc 90 on a step-2 background of the same scale. Step 9 carries white text except sky/mint/lime/yellow/amber (dark text). Docs say step 7 vs 8 role listing is internally inconsistent (table: 7 border, 8 hover border; prose: 8 = focus ring)."
 },
