  "rule": "One theme prop radius = none|small|medium|large|full sets --radius-factor 0 / 0.75 / 1 / 1.5 / 1.5 (full also sets --radius-full 9999px). Each radius-N is base px * scaling * factor. Components pick a step by size (Button size1=radius-1 ... size4=radius-4) as max(var(--radius-N), var(--radius-full)). --radius-thumb is 0.5px for none/small, 9999px for medium+, so checkboxes never go fully round (stay distinct from radios) and switches go pill from medium up. Card size 1-2 radius-4(8px), size 3-4 radius-5(12px), size 5 radius-6(16px)."
 },
